<title>UK: Thai Government Housing Bank sets $200 million FRN.</title>
<headline>Thai Government Housing Bank sets $200 million FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government Housing Bank of Thailand's $200 million five-year FRN has been formally launched, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  THAILAND(A2/A)</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    04.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE    O4.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.65     FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.65     PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-50-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  THAILAND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
